[Na+vinīta]  CL=8 Lacking the method of restraint and observance known as the saṃvara-vinaya, and
lacking the method of abandoning unwholesome states known as the pahāna-vinaya;
not practiced through the power of the higher trainings such as adhisīla-sikkhā (the training in higher morality); untrained, and uncultivated
